<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47007" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sup-pŭto</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subp-</span></b> ). āvi, ātum,
		1, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To cut off below</i>, <i>to
			prune</i>, <i>lop</i>, <i>trim</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oleas teneras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">castaneam bimam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 33, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semina fruticantia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 10, 14, § 70</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To count up</i>, <i>reckon</i>, <i>compute</i> (syn. numero); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sollicitis supputat articulis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					P. 2, 3, 18</span></i>
			 (al. computat): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numeros mensurasque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 88, 26</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pall. Jan. 12</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
